<title>CANADA: Canada new housing price index falls in November.</title>
<headline>Canada new housing price index falls in November.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada's new housing price index fell 1.0 percent in November to 131.8 (base 1986) from November 1995, Statistics Canada said on Monday.</p>
<p>    Index			  Nov     yr pct  month pct</p>
<p> Total			    131.8     -1.0	+0.3</p>
<p> House only		     121.6     -1.0	+0.4</p>
<p> Land only			165.2     -0.5	+0.1</p>
<p>The index measures changes of contractors' selling prices of new residential houses.</p>
<p>A Reuter survey of economists had forecast a 0.1 percent rise in the annual index.</p>
<p>((Reuters Ottawa Bureau 613-235-6745))</p>
